{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ① 기본","level":1,"title":"할인된 가격","desc":"<p>가격 <code>price</code>에서 <code>percent</code>%를 <b>할인한 가격</b>을 돌려주는 함수 <code>discount_price(price, percent)</code>를 만드세요. 예: <code>(10000, 20)</code> → <code>8000.0</code></p>","starter":"def discount_price(price, percent):\n    pass\n","solution":"def discount_price(price, percent):\n    return price * (100 - percent) / 100\n","hint":"<p>할인 후 가격 = 가격 × (100 − 할인율) ÷ 100</p>","tests":[{"call":"discount_price(10000, 20)","expected":8000,"visible":true},{"call":"discount_price(500, 10)","expected":450,"visible":true},{"call":"discount_price(200, 0)","expected":200,"visible":false},{"call":"discount_price(80, 50)","expected":40,"visible":false}],"id":"py-303"}